     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ActorDefinition OrderServer</b></p><a name=\"OrderServer\"> </a><a name=\"hcOrderServer\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Actor: OrderServer </b></td><td>Order Server</td><td>Type: system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>Answers the unit's searches for tagged MedicationRequests and for requested Tasks, including <code>_include=Task:focus</code>. Accepts the MedicationDispense the unit creates and the updates it makes to the Task or MedicationRequest.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"interfaces.html#what-spenser-asks-of-an-order-server\">What Spenser asks of an order server</a>.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"pt\" lang=\"pt\"><hr/><p><b>Portuguese</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narrativa gerada: ActorDefinition OrderServer</b></p><a name=\"pt-OrderServer\"> </a><a name=\"pt-hcOrderServer\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Actor: OrderServer </b></td><td>Servidor de Prescrições</td><td>Tipo: system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>Answers the unit's searches for tagged MedicationRequests and for requested Tasks, including <code>_include=Task:focus</code>. Accepts the MedicationDispense the unit creates and the updates it makes to the Task or MedicationRequest.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"interfaces.html#what-spenser-asks-of-an-order-server\">What Spenser asks of an order server</a>.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"nl\" lang=\"nl\"><hr/><p><b>Dutch</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Gegenereerde narrative: ActorDefinition OrderServer</b></p><a name=\"nl-OrderServer\"> </a><a name=\"nl-hcOrderServer\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Actor: OrderServer </b></td><td>Orderserver</td><td>Type: system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>Answers the unit's searches for tagged MedicationRequests and for requested Tasks, including <code>_include=Task:focus</code>. Accepts the MedicationDispense the unit creates and the updates it makes to the Task or MedicationRequest.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"interfaces.html#what-spenser-asks-of-an-order-server\">What Spenser asks of an order server</a>.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : ActorDefinition OrderServer</b></p><a name=\"fr-OrderServer\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcOrderServer\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Acteur : OrderServer </b></td><td>Serveur d'ordonnances</td><td>Type : system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>Answers the unit's searches for tagged MedicationRequests and for requested Tasks, including <code>_include=Task:focus</code>. Accepts the MedicationDispense the unit creates and the updates it makes to the Task or MedicationRequest.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"interfaces.html#what-spenser-asks-of-an-order-server\">What Spenser asks of an order server</a>.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
